  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Census, MDA - Agricultural Census</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksr&#xe4;kning, MDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksr&#xe4;kningen (General Agricultural Census, GAC) 2010 - 2012 &#xe4;r  den f&#xf6;rsta i Moldavien efter Sovjetunionens uppl&#xf6;sning. Alla jordbruk skall ing&#xe5; och data samlas in om markareal, odlade gr&#xf6;dor,            djurinnehav,arbetskraft och utrustning. J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och milj&#xf6;fr&#xe5;gor  ing&#xe5;r. F&#xe4;ltarbetet skall ske f&#xf6;rsta halv&#xe5;ret 2011. Sida &#xe4;r st&#xf6;rsta    bidragsgivare (50% av totalkostnaden).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Agricultural Census, GAC,2010 - 2012 is the first         agriculture census to be carried out in Moldova after the break up of the Soviet Union. All farms shall be included and data collected on   size of holding, crops grown, animals held, farm labour and           equipment. Gender and environment will be included. The actual field  work will be in the first half of 2011. Sida is the main donor (50%).</narrative>
  </description>
